<p><strong><font color="blue">Updates to site and Proposed Raids</font> </strong><small>Posted Monday, April 30, 2001 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Hello one and all, <br><br>There is a new poll up, please cast your vote. I've added a counter to the bottom of this page and have added a new page so you can check the server status quickly.<br><br>Escaja is proposing a raid to Chardok for this comming weekend. Please check the raid section of our message board. The next major Planes raid will be to PoS. It is being planned for insertion on Friday May 18th. Vallis plans on being there for the week. Kenshuj's raid on the Plane of Growth was a success. Some of us went to sight see and others to kill. Remember, if your proposing a raid, please post the dates on the raid calendar and the details in the forum.<br><br>Congrats to our new members Sakra, Darby, and Tyndall. Remember all full members, please check the message board daily. <br><br>Silvermaine.</p>
