<p><strong><font color="blue">Plane of Growth Friday</font> </strong><small>Posted Wednesday, April 25, 2001 by <a href="mailto:santerre@vallisscortor.com">Santerre</a></small><br>Kenshuj is trying to arrange a trip to PoG Friday, April 27th.  Unlike other Vallis plane raids, this one is totally optional due to the faction hits you will take from killing there.  Also, there are no ARMOR drops for Druids, Rangers, and Paladins in PoG, although there are other drops that may be usable by those classes (druid spells in particular).  The armor that drops for other classes is the equivalent of the thurgadin quest armor, with similar drop rates.<br><br>Killing in PoG will make you KoS in Kelethin, Felwithe, Sister Island in OOT, but NOT Firiona Vie.  You will also become KoS to the "Tunarian Court" mobs in Wakening Lands.  Druids and Rangers killing in PoG should be past the entire "ancient bowl" part of their epic quest if they ever want to complete it.<br><br>Kenshuj has 12 people so far, will need at least 18 to do this, including 1-2 clerics.  I urge anyone that can take part in this to come!  Please the Kenshuj's thread "PoG?" in the Vallis Bar forum for details.</p>
